    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=LOGO DESCRIPTION:\n{{ $('Analyze image (logo)').item.json.content }}\n\nCREATIVE DIRECTION: \n{{ $json.your_creative_direction }}\n\nTECHNICAL SETTINGS:\n- Aspect ratio preference: {{ $json.aspect_ratio }}\n- Model preference: {{ $json.model }}\n- Dialogue: {{ $json.dialogue }}\n\nTASK: Create a complete logo animation prompt. Use Think tool to plan, then output the JSON structure with stringified full_video_prompt.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a video animation expert. Your job is to create detailed prompts for logo animation videos.\n\nWhen a user gives you:\n- A logo description \n- Creative direction\n- Technical preferences\n\nYou must create a complete JSON response with:\n- aspect_ratio: \"16:9\" or \"9:16\" \n- video_model: \"veo3\" or \"veo3_fast\"\n- full_video_prompt: a stringified JSON with complete animation details\n\nThe full_video_prompt string must contain a detailed JSON object with:\n- brand_name (extract from logo)\n- overall_style (creative, professional description)\n- aspect_ratio (text description like \"Landscape 16:9\")\n- video_length: 7.8\n- background_color: {hex: \"#color\", name: \"color name\"}\n- background_fill: \"full\"\n- music: (describe music style)\n- brand_colors: array of {hex, name} colors from logo\n- scenes: exactly 3 scenes with start/end times, visual descriptions, camera movements, sounds, scene_elements, intensity, dialog: null, overlay_text: null\n\nCRITICAL: Use the Think tool first to plan your response. Analyze the logo, understand the creative direction, then build the complete animation prompt.\n\nOutput format: Pure JSON only, no markdown, no explanations.\n\nExample structure:\n{\n  \"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\",\n  \"video_model\": \"veo3\", \n  \"full_video_prompt\": \"{\\\"brand_name\\\":\\\"BrandName\\\",\\\"overall_style\\\":\\\"dynamic, professional\\\",\\\"video_length\\\":7.8,\\\"scenes\\\":[{\\\"start\\\":0.0,\\\"end\\\":2.2,\\\"visual\\\":\\\"Logo appears with smooth animation\\\",\\\"camera\\\":\\\"slow dolly in\\\",\\\"sound\\\":\\\"gentle chimes\\\",\\\"scene_elements\\\":[\\\"floating particles\\\"],\\\"intensity\\\":40,\\\"dialog\\\":null,\\\"overlay_text\\\":null}]}\"\n}"
        }
      },
